{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-5d5a9e18019cdd3b9b846b837553ed95632b6c266a433387","family_id":"KR:006574","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행규칙","kind":"기획재정부령","source_version":"270243","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=270243","source_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","body_sha256":"c7152e441122169fad6d449b16b2734a2fa1824f71b7685ed684e6312b82f595","article_count":0,"full_text":"■ Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act [Attached Form No. 5] <Newly inserted on February 28, 2012>\n\nSpecial Treatment of Blended Oil, etc. at Oil Reservoirs\n[ ] Application  [ ] Application for Amendment\n\n※ Read the instructions below before completing the form, and mark the applicable [ ] box with a check.\n\n| Receipt number | Date received | Processing period |\n|---|---|---|\n| | | Immediately |\n\nApplicant\n\n| Business name (corporate name) | Business registration number |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| Name (representative) | ① Resident (alien) registration number |\n| | |\n| Address (place of business) | Telephone number |\n| | |\n\n| Type of business | Business category | | Business item | |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Name of articles for which special treatment of blended oil, etc. at oil reservoirs is requested | | | | |\n\nDetails of Application\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>Category</th><th>Number</th><th>Location</th><th>Date opened / closed</th><th>Competent tax office</th><th>Remarks</th></tr>\n<tr><td rowspan=\"6\">Oil reservoirs</td><td>1</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>2</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>3</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>4</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>5</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>6</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\nPursuant to Article 8-3 of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act and Article 13-2 (2) of its Enforcement Decree, I [ ] apply for / [ ] apply for amendment of special treatment of blended oil, etc. at oil reservoirs as set out above.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nApplicant: ____________________ (Signature or seal)\n\nTo the Head of the Tax Office / Customs Office\n\nRequired documents: None.\nFee: None.\n\nInstructions for Completion\n\n1. Complete the ① resident (alien) registration number field only for an individual who is not a business operator.\n2. When first applying for special treatment of blended oil, etc. at oil reservoirs, provide details of all oil reservoirs and enter “New” in the remarks field.\n3. When opening an oil reservoir (or resuming business after suspension) or closing an oil reservoir (or suspending business), enter the opening date (resumption date) or closing date (suspension date), and enter “Opening (resumption)” or “Closure (suspension)” in the remarks field.\n4. When relocating an oil reservoir, report the former reservoir as closed and the new reservoir as opened, separately.\n5. For oil reservoirs exceeding the space provided in this application (application for amendment), continue the entries in the Statement of Oil Reservoirs of an Applicant for Special Treatment of Blended Oil, etc. at Oil Reservoirs (the attached schedule to Attached Form No. 5).\n\n210 mm × 297 mm [White paper, 80 g/m², or medium-grade paper, 80 g/m²]\n\n■ Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act [Attached Schedule to Attached Form No. 5] <Newly inserted on February 28, 2012>\n\nStatement of Oil Reservoirs of an Applicant for Special Treatment of Blended Oil, etc. at Oil Reservoirs\n\nApplicant's business registration number: ______ - ______ - ______\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>Number</th><th>Location</th><th>Date opened / closed</th><th>Competent tax office</th><th>Remarks</th></tr><tr><td>7</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><th>Number</th><th>Location</th><th>Date opened / closed</th><th>Competent tax office</th><th>Remarks</th></tr><tr><td>8</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><th>Number</th><th>Location</th><th>Date opened / closed</th><th>Competent tax office</th><th>Remarks</th></tr><tr><td>9</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><th>Number</th><th>Location</th><th>Date opened / closed</th><th>Competent tax office</th><th>Remarks</th></tr><tr><td>10</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><th>Number</th><th>Location</th><th>Date opened / closed</th><th>Competent tax office</th><th>Remarks</th></tr><tr><td>11</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><th>Number</th><th>Location</th><th>Date opened / closed</th><th>Competent tax office</th><th>Remarks</th></tr><tr><td>12</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><th>Number</th><th>Location</th><th>Date opened / closed</th><th>Competent tax office</th><th>Remarks</th></tr><tr><td>13</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><th>Number</th><th>Location</th><th>Date opened / closed</th><th>Competent tax office</th><th>Remarks</th></tr><tr><td>14</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\nInstructions for Completion\n\n1. Use this form where there are seven or more oil reservoirs and they exceed the oil-reservoir fields in the application for special treatment of blended oil, etc. at oil reservoirs.\n2. When first applying for the special treatment, provide details of all oil reservoirs and enter “New” in the remarks field.\n3. When opening an oil reservoir (or resuming business after suspension) or closing an oil reservoir (or suspending business), enter the opening date (resumption date) or closing date (suspension date), and enter “Opening (resumption)” or “Closure (suspension)” in the remarks field.\n4. When relocating an oil reservoir, enter the former reservoir as closed and the new reservoir as opened, in separate entries.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\5b1e7d390eaa32cf4bedb1625b78b195c3751c8721b3a2f74925400101b7eeb1.ascii.json","sha256":"5b1e7d390eaa32cf4bedb1625b78b195c3751c8721b3a2f74925400101b7eeb1"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"de7396584800595bd5eca3cd0dc4bf875beb9a7aad76200a5b449db2c60536fe","unit_key":"form-000500F"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"87fd3e51930d46cdfa94b3efa25272618a1f2e5d11a43e5e63758942dcedac58","unit_key":"form-000600F"}],"source_component_text_sha256":"de7396584800595bd5eca3cd0dc4bf875beb9a7aad76200a5b449db2c60536fe","source_law_id":"kr-006574-270243-ko","source_review_complete":true,"source_xml_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","target_body_sha256":"2371a527ee26cff6f1224f2032512932c70cbd45d539089190479b5e05e70815","unit_key":"form-000500F"},"unit_key":"form-000500F"}],"author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\rule\\en.title.json","sha256":"caf0dcf5c50a9f70581ce8b6bff50b953f3d3a7a30a17edbf83172f05b5f4e7e"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\rule\\en.units.parts\\form-000500F.json","sha256":"0acec68260004dc4a7f7c71959e46ddeed1312e8c0e271de98c5d447c2f